        "width": "full-width",
        "title": "Monster Piercing | Gold Flatbacks",
        "text": "<p>Elevate your style with our Gold Flat Back Studs Collection, featuring push fit and threaded studs in luxurious 14K and 9K gold. Designed for comfort and beauty, each stud offers a secure fit and a dainty, minimalist look, perfect for ear, cartilage, tragus, and helix piercings.</p><p>Crafted with precision and hypoallergenic materials, these pieces are made to shine effortlessly from day to night. Choose from classic gold balls, sparkling crystal studs, and delicate motifs that reflect your personal style. Perfect for those who love subtle luxury and trendy body jewellery that never goes out of fashion.</p>",
